  "description": "It was discovered that Yaws did not properly sanitize XML input in its\nWebDAV implementation. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to\nperform XML external entity injection attacks. (CVE-2020-24379)\n\nIt was discovered that Yaws mishandled certain input when running CGI\nscripts. A remote attacker could possibly use this issue to execute\narbitrary commands. (CVE-2020-24916)",
